## 🔍 Finding Information

### Navigation Tips

1. **Browsing?** Start with category READMEs (e.g., [01-whitepapers/README.md](./01-whitepapers/README.md))
2. **Searching?** Use Ctrl+F or GitHub's search
3. **Lost?** Return to [00-START-HERE.md](./00-START-HERE.md)
4. **Need overview?** See [07-reference/](./07-reference/)

### By Role

- **New User**: [00-START-HERE.md](./00-START-HERE.md) → [04-guides/quickstart/](./04-guides/quickstart/)
